---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Divider from "../components/Divider.astro";
import Photo from "../components/Photo.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Neighborhood"
  description="SE Como and Marcy-Holmes, Minneapolis — Elmwood's home turf, a short walk from the U of M and Dinkytown."
>
  <section class="section hero-sm">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Neighborhood</p>
      <h1>SE Como &amp; Marcy-Holmes, from people who actually live here.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Our office sits at 1420 Rollins Ave SE, and our seven buildings are all within about
        a mile of it. We didn't pick this stretch of Southeast Minneapolis by accident — it's
        the sweet spot between campus energy and an actual neighborhood.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Divider />

  <section class="section area">
    <div class="wrap area__grid">
      <Photo label="Dinkytown storefronts" ratio="4 / 3" tone="sage" />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Dinkytown</p>
        <h2>The heart of it all is a short walk away.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Dinkytown has been the U of M's front porch for generations — coffee shops that
          stay open through finals week, late-night food when the library kicks you out,
          bookstores, and enough foot traffic that you'll run into someone you know most
          days. Most Elmwood residences are close enough to walk it without a second thought.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sage area">
    <div class="wrap area__grid area__grid--reverse">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Getting Around</p>
        <h2>You don't need a car here.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          East Bank campus is a 15 to 20 minute walk, or a quick bike ride, from most Elmwood
          buildings. If the weather has other plans, the Metro Transit bus stops right at the
          corner and connects you across campus and into the rest of the city. Covered bike
          racks are on-site at our properties for the days you'd rather pedal.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Photo label="Bike rack outside an Elmwood building" ratio="4 / 3" tone="brass" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section area">
    <div class="wrap area__grid">
      <Photo label="Van Cleve Park in autumn" ratio="4 / 3" tone="sage" />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Parks &amp; Recreation</p>
        <h2>Green space and game days, both close by.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Van Cleve Park anchors the SE Como side of the neighborhood — tennis courts, open
          field, a rec center, and a genuinely good place to decompress between classes. On
          the sports side, you're within easy reach of Bierman Field Athletic Complex,
          U.S. Bank Stadium, and Mariucci Arena, so game day doesn't require a road trip.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sage area">
    <div class="wrap area__grid area__grid--reverse">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Daily Life</p>
        <h2>The errands take care of themselves.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Convenience stores and everyday shopping are close enough that you won't need to
          plan a special trip. Families in the neighborhood also have the U of M daycare
          center just one block from several of our buildings — a small detail that matters
          a lot if it applies to you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <Photo label="Corner store near campus" ratio="4 / 3" tone="brass" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta">
    <div class="wrap cta__inner">
      <h2>Still deciding where to live this year?</h2>
      <p class="lede cta__lede">
        Come see the neighborhood in person — our office is a five-minute walk from most of
        our buildings, and we're happy to show you around.
      </p>
      <div class="cta__actions">
        <a href="/floor-plans" class="btn btn-primary">View Floor Plans</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule a Visit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-sm h1 {
    margin-block: 0.9rem 1rem;
    max-width: 40rem;
  }

  .hero-sm .lede {
    max-width: 38rem;
  }

  .area__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .area__grid--reverse {
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
  }

  .area__grid--reverse > *:first-child {
    order: 2;
  }

  .area h2 {
    margin-block: 0.9rem 1rem;
  }

  .cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .cta__lede {
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
  }

  .cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .area__grid,
    .area__grid--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .area__grid--reverse > *:first-child {
      order: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
